      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T12:24:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If ilb initial is 0, then when hook is not registered, find ilb will return CPU 0.\nBut when hook is not registered, it should do for_each_cpu_and() to find best ilb cpu, instead of return CPU 0 direct.\n\nWe want to set ilb as nr_cpu_ids by our vendor when ilb cpu not be found.\nSo we set ilb initial is -1.\nIt means anyone doesn\u0027t register the hook or the registered hook doesn\u0027t do anything, instead of ilb cpu not be found by vendor.\n\nThe patch was merged at android13-5.15.\nSo I think we can use same patch for android14-6.1.",
      "parentUuid": "c0feab3d_e598b983",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10890,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 10890,
        "endChar": 13
